{"type":"text","timestamp":1790402186272,"sessionID":"ses_f23b98442ffeRq9Z0JU52m1tBt","part":{"id":"prt_0dc494c06001X9HnZKyL5FY5Sy","messageID":"msg_0dc48d6ae001hvhLQ368oty4qD","sessionID":"ses_f23b98442ffeRq9Z0JU52m1tBt","type":"text","text":"The project already has fleet groups and a minimal `BattleUnit`; the main integration concern is initialization order. I’ll make the range setter robust to scene loading, then explicitly reapply it from `BattleUnit._set_stats` after the unit stats are duplicated.","time":{"start":1790402186246,"end":1790402186248},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0214dcc20d7105a8016ab75e85a94887d184842e5c9f4b837c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
